<h1>M-Pesa Payment Integration</h1>
<p class="subtitle"><strong>JK Organics E-Commerce Platform</strong></p>
<p class="meta">Proposal &amp; Project Scope &nbsp;|&nbsp; June 2026</p>

<h2>At a Glance</h2>
<table>
  <tr><th>Service</th><td>M-Pesa STK Push payment integration</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Total Cost</th><td><strong>KES 14,000</strong> (one-time fee)</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Timeline</th><td><strong>5 working days</strong> maximum</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Scope</th><td>Plug-in M-Pesa into your live online store</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Prepared for</th><td>JK Organics</td></tr>
</table>

<h2>Introduction</h2>
<p>
  This document outlines the M-Pesa payment integration for the JK Organics online store.
  Once complete, your customers will be able to pay securely using M-Pesa directly at checkout —
  alongside your existing <strong>Cash on Delivery</strong> option.
</p>
<p>
  The integration uses Safaricom's official <strong>Daraja API (STK Push)</strong> — the same
  technology used by leading Kenyan e-commerce platforms. Payments go directly to your registered
  Paybill or Till number.
</p>

<h2>Important Assumption</h2>
<div class="highlight">
  <p><strong>This proposal assumes your JK Organics website is already deployed and fully operational</strong> —
  including the online store, checkout, order management, hosting, and SSL certificate.</p>
  <p>Our work is to <strong>plug in M-Pesa payments</strong> to the existing system: connect your Safaricom
  credentials, configure the payment flow, test end-to-end, and go live. <strong>This is not a new website build.</strong></p>
  <p>The quoted cost (KES 14,000) and timeline (5 days) apply when the prerequisites in this document
  are ready before we begin.</p>
</div>

<h2>What You Will Get</h2>
<p>After integration, your customers will be able to:</p>
<ol>
  <li>Select <strong>"Pay with M-Pesa"</strong> at checkout and enter their M-Pesa phone number.</li>
  <li>Place their order — the order is saved in your store immediately.</li>
  <li>Receive an <strong>M-Pesa prompt (STK Push)</strong> on their phone.</li>
  <li>Enter their M-Pesa PIN to confirm payment.</li>
  <li>See a <strong>confirmation page</strong> with their order details and M-Pesa receipt number.</li>
</ol>
<p>
  If a payment fails, is cancelled, or times out, the customer can <strong>resend the M-Pesa prompt</strong>
  without placing a new order. Your team will see paid orders marked clearly in the WooCommerce admin panel.
</p>

<h2>Customer Payment Flow</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Customer adds products to cart and proceeds to <strong>Checkout</strong>.</li>
  <li>Customer fills in billing details, including <strong>M-Pesa phone number</strong>.</li>
  <li>Customer selects <strong>Pay with M-Pesa</strong> and places the order.</li>
  <li>M-Pesa payment prompt is sent to their phone.</li>
  <li>Customer enters PIN on phone.</li>
  <li><strong>On success:</strong> order is marked as paid and customer sees order confirmation.</li>
  <li><strong>On failure:</strong> clear error message is shown with option to try again.</li>
</ul>

<h2>What We Need From JK Organics</h2>
<p>Please have the following ready <strong>before Day 1</strong> of the integration:</p>
<table>
  <tr><th>#</th><th>Item</th><th>Details</th></tr>
  <tr><td>1</td><td>Safaricom Daraja API account</td><td>Register at <em>developer.safaricom.co.ke</em> and create a production app</td></tr>
  <tr><td>2</td><td>Consumer Key &amp; Secret</td><td>From your Daraja developer portal</td></tr>
  <tr><td>3</td><td>Paybill or Till number</td><td>Your business M-Pesa shortcode</td></tr>
  <tr><td>4</td><td>Lipa Na M-Pesa Online passkey</td><td>From Safaricom M-Pesa business portal</td></tr>
  <tr><td>5</td><td>Live website URL (HTTPS)</td><td>Your store must be accessible on a secure domain</td></tr>
  <tr><td>6</td><td>Test M-Pesa phone line</td><td>A number we can use for live payment testing</td></tr>
  <tr><td>7</td><td>Hosting access</td><td>Ability to add configuration settings to your server (e.g. Vercel)</td></tr>
</table>

<h2>Project Timeline — 5 Working Days</h2>
<p>The schedule below assumes your credentials and prerequisites are ready on Day 1,
and that feedback is provided within the same working day.</p>
<table>
  <tr><th>Day</th><th>Focus</th><th>Outcome</th></tr>
  <tr><td><strong>Day 1</strong></td><td>Setup &amp; credentials</td><td>M-Pesa credentials connected; system configured</td></tr>
  <tr><td><strong>Day 2</strong></td><td>Backend integration</td><td>Payment requests and confirmations working</td></tr>
  <tr><td><strong>Day 3</strong></td><td>Checkout &amp; payment screens</td><td>Full customer journey from cart to payment</td></tr>
  <tr><td><strong>Day 4</strong></td><td>Testing &amp; quality checks</td><td>All payment scenarios tested (success, cancel, retry)</td></tr>
  <tr><td><strong>Day 5</strong></td><td>Go-live &amp; handover</td><td><strong>M-Pesa live on JK Organics</strong>; team briefed</td></tr>
</table>
<p><em>Note: If delays are caused by missing Safaricom credentials or site access, the timeline pauses until those items are resolved.</em></p>

<h2>Detailed Work Plan</h2>

<h3>Phase 1 — Setup (Day 1)</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Confirm live website is running on HTTPS</li>
  <li>Receive and securely configure M-Pesa credentials</li>
  <li>Register payment callback URL with Safaricom</li>
  <li>Confirm Paybill or Till payment type</li>
</ul>

<h3>Phase 2 — Payment Engine (Day 2)</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Connect M-Pesa STK Push to your order system</li>
  <li>Set up automatic payment confirmation from Safaricom</li>
  <li>Enable payment status tracking</li>
  <li>Enable retry for failed or timed-out payments</li>
</ul>

<h3>Phase 3 — Customer Experience (Day 3)</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Add Pay with M-Pesa option on checkout</li>
  <li>Build payment waiting page with clear instructions</li>
  <li>Show payment success and failure messages</li>
  <li>Ensure Cash on Delivery continues to work as before</li>
</ul>

<h3>Phase 4 — Testing (Day 4)</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Test successful payment end-to-end</li>
  <li>Test customer cancellation on phone</li>
  <li>Test payment timeout and retry</li>
  <li>Verify orders appear correctly in your admin panel</li>
</ul>

<h3>Phase 5 — Launch (Day 5)</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Final live payment test on production</li>
  <li>Brief your team on checking M-Pesa payments in admin</li>
  <li>Handover documentation</li>
  <li>Client sign-off</li>
</ul>

<h2>Responsibilities</h2>
<table>
  <tr><th>Task</th><th>JK Organics</th><th>Developer</th></tr>
  <tr><td>Safaricom business account &amp; Paybill/Till</td><td>Yes</td><td></td></tr>
  <tr><td>Daraja API credentials &amp; passkey</td><td>Yes</td><td></td></tr>
  <tr><td>Website hosting &amp; domain</td><td>Yes</td><td></td></tr>
  <tr><td>Provide test M-Pesa number</td><td>Yes</td><td></td></tr>
  <tr><td>M-Pesa integration &amp; configuration</td><td></td><td>Yes</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Payment testing (technical)</td><td></td><td>Yes</td></tr>
  <tr><td>User acceptance testing</td><td>Yes</td><td></td></tr>
  <tr><td>Final go-live approval</td><td>Yes</td><td></td></tr>
</table>

<h2>Investment</h2>
<table>
  <tr><th>Description</th><th>Amount (KES)</th></tr>
  <tr><td>M-Pesa STK Push integration (setup, testing, go-live, handover)</td><td><strong>14,000</strong></td></tr>
</table>

<h3>Included in KES 14,000</h3>
<ul>
  <li>M-Pesa payment option on checkout</li>
  <li>STK Push payment prompts to customer phones</li>
  <li>Automatic order update when payment succeeds</li>
  <li>Payment retry for failed or cancelled payments</li>
  <li>Customer-friendly error messages</li>
  <li>End-to-end testing and production go-live</li>
  <li>Brief handover for your team</li>
</ul>

<h3>Not Included</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Safaricom Paybill/Till registration fees</li>
  <li>Per-transaction M-Pesa charges (billed by Safaricom)</li>
  <li>New website development or deployment</li>
  <li>WordPress / WooCommerce setup</li>
  <li>Ongoing maintenance after go-live (unless agreed separately)</li>
</ul>

<h2>Acceptance Checklist</h2>
<p>The integration will be considered complete when all items below are confirmed:</p>
<ul class="checklist">
  <li>☐ &nbsp;Customers can pay with M-Pesa from checkout on the live site</li>
  <li>☐ &nbsp;M-Pesa prompt arrives on the phone number entered at checkout</li>
  <li>☐ &nbsp;Successful payments mark orders as paid with M-Pesa receipt number</li>
  <li>☐ &nbsp;Failed or cancelled payments show a clear message and allow retry</li>
  <li>☐ &nbsp;Cash on Delivery still works normally</li>
  <li>☐ &nbsp;JK Organics team can verify payments in the admin panel</li>
</ul>

